AB  - As artificial intelligence (AI) becomes more accessible and widespread in its implementation the opportunities it poses are ever-expanding. This paper explores machine learning tools such as generative adversarial networks, and their ability to speculate unseen Dreamscapes, using data from the real world. The research leverages creative AI as a generating agent to speculate cityscapes and visualize them within an immersive virtual reality (VR) environment. Leading to the creation of “Dreamscape AI”, a tool for architectural investigation. Culminating in an exploration within the future of video games design wherein AI leads to self-generative gamespaces and their graphics being user-driven. © 2021, Springer Nature Switzerland AG.
