TI  - Supporting iterative virtual reality analytics design and evaluation by systematic generation of surrogate clustered datasets
PY  - 2021
T2  - Proceedings - 2021 IEEE International Symposium on Mixed and Augmented Reality, ISMAR 2021
SP  - 376
EP  - 385
DO  - 10.1109/ISMAR52148.2021.00054
SN  - 1554-7868
