TI  - The Aesthetics of Uncertainty: Co-Constructing Playful Ways of Knowing and Understanding Extended Reality (XR) and Care Identity.
PY  - 2022
T2  - ACM International Conference Proceeding Series
PB  - Association for Computing Machinery
DO  - 10.1145/3547522.3547720
