AB  - This paper draws on a substantial body of theoretical and empirical research on generative artificial intelligence and spatial data mining algorithms enabling virtual employee engagement, human capital development, and cognitive analytics management. A quantitative literature review of ProQuest, Scopus, and the Web of Science was carried out throughout August 2023, with search terms including “generative artificial intelligence and haptic and biometric sensor tech-nologies” + “spatial data mining and image processing computational algorithms,” “virtual team performance and behavior tracking tools,” and “immersive extended reality environments.” As research published in 2023 was inspected, only 170 articles satisfied the eligibility criteria, and 53 mainly empirical sources were selected. Data visualization tools: Dimensions (bibliometric mapping) and VOSviewer (layout algorithms). Reporting quality assessment tool: PRISMA. Methodological quality assessment tools include: AMSTAR, Distiller SR, ROBIS, and SRDR. © 2023, Addleton Academic Publishers. All rights reserved.
