TI  - Placing Human Animations into 3D Scenes by Learning Interaction- and Geometry-Driven Keyframes
PY  - 2023
T2  - 2023 IEEE/CVF Winter Conference on Applications of Computer Vision (WACV)
SP  - 300
EP  - 310
DO  - 10.1109/WACV56688.2023.00038
