TI  - A Generative Multi-Resolution Pyramid and Normal-Conditioning 3D Cloth Draping
PY  - 2024
T2  - Proceedings - 2024 IEEE Winter Conference on Applications of Computer Vision, WACV 2024
SP  - 8694
EP  - 8703
