TI  - Elevating Medical Training: A Synergistic Fusion of AI and VR for Immersive Anatomy Learning and Practical Procedure Mastery
PY  - 2024
T2  - 2024 International Conference on System, Computation, Automation and Networking (ICSCAN)
SP  - 1
