TI  - Enhanced Soccer Training Simulation Using Progressive Wasserstein GAN and Termite Life Cycle Optimization in Virtual Reality
PY  - 2024
T2  - International Arab Journal of Information Technology
VL  - 21
IS  - 4
SP  - 549
EP  - 559
