TI  - AI support meets AR visualization for Alice and Bob: personalized learning based on individual ChatGPT feedback in an AR quantum cryptography experiment for physics lab courses
PY  - 2025
T2  - EPJ Quantum Technology
VL  - 12
IS  - 1
DO  - 10.1140/epjqt/s40507-025-00310-z
