AB  - This study explores the application of virtual reality technology combined with artificial intelligence and big data in knowledge dissemination. By constructing a knowledge dissemination model based on virtual reality and optimizing the dissemination process using AI and big data technologies, the research aims to enhance the efficiency and effectiveness of knowledge dissemination. Specific objectives include: building a knowledge dissemination model based on virtual reality to achieve immersive knowledge communication; utilizing AI technology for intelligent generation and personalized recommendation of knowledge content; and analyzing user behavior during the dissemination process through big data technology to optimize dissemination strategies.
