TI  - Can AI Inspire Biophilic Design in Immersive Virtual Reality Workspaces to Enhance Well-Being?
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings - 2025 IEEE International Symposium on Mixed and Augmented Reality, ISMAR 2025
SP  - 1575
EP  - 1585
DO  - 10.1109/ISMAR67309.2025.00161
