TI  - Can You Move These over There? Exploring an LLM-based VR Mover to Support Natural Multi-object Manipulation
PY  - 2025
T2  - UIST 2025 - Proceedings of the 38th Annual ACM Symposium on User Interface Software and Technology
PB  - Association for Computing Machinery
