TI  - DEFENDING THE METAVERSE: A SURVEY ON DEEPFAKE DETECTION AND AVATAR-BASED THREAT MITIGATION
PY  - 2025
T2  - International Journal of Applied Mathematics
VL  - 38
IS  - 1S
