TI  - Demo Abstract: RAG-Driven 3D Question Answering in Edge-Assisted Virtual Reality
PY  - 2025
T2  - IEEE INFOCOM 2025 - IEEE Conference on Computer Communications Workshops (INFOCOM WKSHPS)
SP  - 1
