TI  - Design and Research of a Stress-Relief and Mindfulness Virtual Reality Training Environment Based on Generative Adversarial Networks
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings - 2025 2nd International Conference on Intelligent Computing and Robotics, ICICR 2025
SP  - 749
EP  - 754
DO  - 10.1109/ICICR65456.2025.00134
