TI  - ExciteVR: Effective Cybersickness Mitigation in Virtual Reality using Explainable Artificial Intelligence and Large Language Models
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings - 2025 IEEE International Symposium on Mixed and Augmented Reality Adjunct, ISMAR-Adjunct 2025
SP  - 644
EP  - 647
