AB  - General Experimentation and Natural Interface Utility System (GENIUS), is an AI personal assistant specifically tailored for scientists engaged in experimentation and research. GENIUS integrates Large Language Models (LLM), with immersive mixed reality (XR) capabilities. Through natural speech recognition, users can interact effortlessly with GENIUS to ask questions, visualize and manipulate complex 3D models, and execute computational jobs on Argonne Leadership Computing Facility (ALCF) supercomputers. © 2025 IEEE.
