TI  - GPI-Former: Generative Priors and Physics-Informed Transformer for 3D-2D Non-Rigid Registration
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings - 2025 International Conference on Virtual Reality and Visualization, ICVRV 2025
SP  - 1077
EP  - 1082
DO  - 10.1109/ICVRV67992.2025.00186
