TI  - Multi-Modal Large Language Model Driven Augmented Reality Situated Visualization: The Case of Wine Recognition
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings - 2025 IEEE/CVF Winter Conference on Applications of Computer Vision Workshops, WACVW 2025
SP  - 1223
EP  - 1232
DO  - 10.1109/WACVW65960.2025.00145
