TI  - Re-Engaging Driver Attention Using ChatGPT: A VR-EEG Study on Stress Impact and Driving Performance
PY  - 2025
T2  - Conference Proceedings - 2025 IEEE International Conference on Metrology for eXtended Reality, Artificial Intelligence and Neural Engineering, MetroXRAINE 2025
SP  - 669
