TI  - VR-AI Self-Generative Data Pipeline: Adaptive AI-Assisted Creative Tools via Latent-Space Synthesis and Adversarial Refinement
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings - 2025 3rd International Conference on Computer Graphics and Image Processing, CGIP 2025
