TI  - Adaptive Parent Training for Childhood Aggression: A Virtual Reality System with AI-Driven Behavioral Feedback
PY  - 2026
T2  - 2026 23rd International Learning and Technology Conference (L&T)
VL  - 23
SP  - 35
EP  - 40
DO  - 10.1109/LT68265.2026.11592551
