TI  - AI-Augmented Immersive Learning Environments: Integrating Generative AI and Real-Time Interaction for Personalized Teaching
PY  - 2026
T2  - 2026 International Conference on AI in Education Technology and Applications, AIETA 2026
SP  - 196
