TI  - CogniVox - Interactive Training System for Enhancing Public Speaking and Interview Skills
PY  - 2026
T2  - 2026 IEEE International Conference on Automatic Control and Intelligent Systems, I2CACIS 2026 - Conference Proceedings
SP  - 365
EP  - 370
