TI  - Filling the Silence: Educating Users during Long-Latency Tasks in Conversational Procedural Generation
PY  - 2026
T2  - Proceedings - 2026 IEEE International Conference on Artificial Intelligence and eXtended and Virtual Reality, AIxVR 2026
SP  - 147
EP  - 156
DO  - 10.1109/AIxVR67263.2026.00025
