TI  - Immersive Narrative Mechanism of Cultural Heritage Transmission Enabled by Generative Artificial Intelligence from the Perspective of Human-Machine Collaboration
PY  - 2026
T2  - 2026 International Conference on Intelligent Engineering and Next-Gen Healthcare Systems (IEHNS)
SP  - 1
