AB  - Prompting for Mindfulness is a virtual reality prototype that explores how user-prompted generative AI can be used to create a personalized, multi-sensory environment for mindful guided breathing. Its application context is as a tool to relieve symptoms of emotional-coping related digital platform overuse. Through a spoken natural language prompt, users describe their ideal relaxation space which is translated into a skybox and soundscape using AI. Users' attention is then directed to their internal bodily sensations by tactile cardio-feedback of their heart rate, followed by guided box breathing via synchronized visual and haptic cues, finishing with cardio feedback again. By immersing users in an engaging environment that they have co-created, the user is motivated to direct all attentional focus towards the present moment and body sensations through visual, auditory, and tactile engagement. The prototype aims to facilitate a meaningful connection to the environment itself via the personalization element to increase engagement with the overall experience. © 2026 Copyright held by the owner/author(s).
