TI  - The Immersive Frontier: Reimagining Indian Education through Metaverse Integration
PY  - 2026
T2  - 2026 5th International Conference on Innovative Practices in Technology and Management (ICIPTM)
SP  - 1
EP  - 5
DO  - 10.1109/ICIPTM69057.2026.11465373
