AB  - With the development of educational technology, how to improve college students' knowledge mastery and application ability has become an important topic in educational research. To address this issue, this paper proposes a generative tool based on multi-task learning and attention mechanism, aiming to optimize students' learning effects. By constructing a comprehensive multi-task learning framework, a personalized learning path is designed in combination with students' learning progress and needs. The experimental results show that the tool performs outstandingly in improving learning accuracy and speeding up task completion time, especially in multi-task learning scenarios, which can effectively promote students' in-depth understanding and application of knowledge. The research results provide a new direction for the innovation of educational technology, especially in the promotion of personalized learning and intelligent education tools. It has important application potential. The innovation of this paper lies in proposing an effective combination of multi-task learning and attention mechanism, and proving its practical value in the field of education.
